        VerseModel(verse: 35, text: "The Father loveth the Son, and hath given all things into his hand."),
        VerseModel(verse: 36, text: "He that believeth on the Son hath everlasting life: and he that believeth not the Son shall not see life; but the wrath of God abideth on him."),
