        VerseModel(verse: 11, text: "Verily, verily, I say unto thee, We speak that which we know, and bear witness of that which we have seen; and ye receive not our witness."),
        VerseModel(verse: 12, text: "If I told you earthly things and ye believe not, how shall ye believe if I tell you heavenly things?"),
        VerseModel(verse: 13, text: "And no one hath ascended into heaven, but he that descended out of heaven, even the Son of man, who is in heaven."),
        VerseModel(verse: 14, text: "And as Moses lifted up the serpent in the wilderness, even so must the Son of man be lifted up;"),
        VerseModel(verse: 15, text: "that whosoever believeth may in him have eternal life."),
        VerseModel(verse: 16, text: "For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth on him should not perish, but have eternal life."),
